alerts-wind-name = Wind
alerts-wind-desc = The winds of magic that your spells draw from. They return slowly. Overcasting is possible, but the winds will not forgive it.
wind-not-enough = The winds are too thin for that!

wind-gust-whisper = The winds whisper something you almost understand.
wind-gust-flash = The winds snap back at you in a burst of light!
wind-gust-swap = The winds trade you for someone else.
wind-gust-banana = The winds find your pockets and make a mess.
wind-gust-smoke = The winds exhale at you.
wind-gust-sparks = The winds crackle against your skin.
wind-gust-sneeze = You sneeze. Somewhere, a very old thing takes offence.
